{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A blend of Monopoly, RPG elements, and devious strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cho Noi</i> is a <strong>multiplayer digital board game</strong> where up to 4 players go head-to-head to become the wealthiest merchant! Players move around the board via dice to gather collectable stamps, fight enemies for goods, and build storefronts to sell gained goods. Take down other merchants by any means necessary to rack up the most coins in the whole market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunting and Gathering!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/8327aa562ceae6541c727a80b6a43970.poster.avif?t=1769474522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/8327aa562ceae6541c727a80b6a43970.webm?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/8327aa562ceae6541c727a80b6a43970.mp4?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat wild monsters in combat to gain\u00a0<strong>experience</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>items</strong>\u00a0to gain an upper hand. Items range from light heals to game-changing buffs! Use the items for yourself or put them up for sale in your stores!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duke It Out Against Friend and Foe!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/8cea9dd9310b9cfe187d6637c15c5525.poster.avif?t=1769474522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/8cea9dd9310b9cfe187d6637c15c5525.webm?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/8cea9dd9310b9cfe187d6637c15c5525.mp4?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights take the form of <strong>dice turn-based combat</strong> akin to Rock-Paper-Scissors, but in 2 phases. One combatant attacks first, the other defends, then they swap <i>(Attacking &lt;=&gt; Defending)</i>. Both pick what action to throw out. Actions are based on weapon types <i>(Melee, Gun, Magic)</i> which take the form of stat dice. When an action is selected, both combatants roll that action type's dice. The number rolled is decided on the die's unique face values.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up and Turn the Tide!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/c87d3f30bd763484bf423285837757ae.poster.avif?t=1769474522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/c87d3f30bd763484bf423285837757ae.webm?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/c87d3f30bd763484bf423285837757ae.mp4?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augment individual die faces</strong>\u00a0beyond the standard 1-6 rolls! Cater your playstyle in combat to your liking! Amplify your highs, pad out your lows, or maybe even adapt to counter your opponents' dice! Go all or nothing and augment all the way up to a natural\u00a0<strong>[11]</strong> die face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hook, Line and Sinker!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/9173e800ae800be13dfa9463dd9256c1.poster.avif?t=1769474522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/9173e800ae800be13dfa9463dd9256c1.webm?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/9173e800ae800be13dfa9463dd9256c1.mp4?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build stores</strong> in any empty tile and stock up to 3 items to sell per store! When other players land on your store, they must buy one item. Should they buy a cheap item to get off easy or an expensive yet strong item to get back at the owner? The choice is up to them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cash it In!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/f32d110a200a24b9bf55f1ef4a14a0f4.poster.avif?t=1769474522\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/f32d110a200a24b9bf55f1ef4a14a0f4.webm?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/extras/f32d110a200a24b9bf55f1ef4a14a0f4.mp4?t=1769474522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect<strong> colored stamps</strong> placed around the board. You can only hold one of each color at a time. Head to the\u00a0<strong>Central Exchange</strong>\u00a0to trade in your colored stamps at once for tons of coin! The more stamps you have, the more coin you get!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four-player board game experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditionally hand-drawn visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact shop management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet deceptive\u00a0turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 wild enemies to encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ zany items to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augmentable die faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little guys with guns</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644880?t=1769474522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/90b1eee2bf14d325b1f4663ab99597022b9b48f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769474522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/5db2eb4532a5a53f1ac9728c99f083f8f534e687/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769474522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644880/5db2eb4532a5a53f1ac9728c99f083f8f534e687/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769474522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A blend of Monopoly, RPG elements, and devious 